.play.fx-rose-petals .rose-petals-p{animation:rose-petals-fall 10s linear infinite backwards}
.play.fx-rose-petals .rose-petals-q{animation:rose-petals-sway 3.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.play.fx-rose-petals .rose-petals-r{animation:rose-petals-flip 3.6s linear infinite}
